OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 29 Sep to Tue 13 OctFA
OL,6,Fchangeable theme is likely to
OL,7,Fcontinue, with further spells of rain
OL,8,Fand showers arriving from the North
OL,9,FAtlantic, perhaps accompanied by
OL,10,Fstrong winds at times. These are more
OL,11,Flikely to affect northern and western
OL,12,Fparts, but could also affect the wider
OL,13,FUK if such systems push east or
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards. Some settled spells
OL,15,Fare also possible during this period,
OL,16,Fthese most likely in the south.
OL,17,FTemperatures for the period as a whole
OL,18,Fwill probably be close to average
OL,19,Foverall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
